N2  - Forde et al.1 reported on a randomized clinical trial (CheckMate 816) and showed that neoadjuvant therapy with nivolumab plus chemotherapy led to improved event-free survival and pathological complete response rate in patients with resectable non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC).
